flowchart TD
    Start([Handoff needed]) --> Trigger{Why hand off?}
    Trigger -->|Customer requests a person| Prepare
    Trigger -->|Customer is upset or issue is sensitive| Prepare
    Trigger -->|Agent is uncertain / evidence inadequate| Prepare
    Trigger -->|Tool result or execution outcome needs investigation| Prepare

    Prepare[Build concise case summary from verified conversation and tool results] --> Minimize[Remove unnecessary personal data, credentials, and secrets]
    Minimize --> Context[Attach trusted customer/session reference, reason, relevant operation IDs, and source citations where applicable]
    Context --> Submit[Submit handoff through the configured support boundary]
    Submit --> Result{Did support system confirm receipt?}

    Result -->|Accepted with reference| Record[Record handoff event and reference in audit trail]
    Record --> Tell[Tell customer handoff was accepted and provide reference / next step]

    Result -->|Rejected or unavailable| Failure[Record failed handoff attempt without claiming acceptance]
    Failure --> Safe[Explain that live handoff could not be confirmed; provide approved fallback or ask how to proceed]

    Result -->|Outcome unknown| Unknown[Reconcile handoff status using correlation/reference if available]
    Unknown --> Reconciled{Can receipt be confirmed?}
    Reconciled -->|Yes| Record
    Reconciled -->|No / still unknown| UnknownRecord[Record unresolved handoff outcome]
    UnknownRecord --> Safe

    Record --> End([End])
    Safe --> End

    Note[Do not invent a case number or claim that a human has received the case unless the support boundary confirms receipt.]:::note
    Tell -.-> Note
    Safe -.-> Note

    classDef note fill:#fff4cc,stroke:#b38b00,color:#333
